window.products.push({"id":1123146,"name":"Hongtamoya Over The Toilet Storage Cabinet with Drawer, Bathroom Shelves Over Toilet with Large Storage Space, Over Toilet Bathroom Organizer with Adj","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ifsUSpUhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Attached to Wall】This bathroom shelves over toilet has a pre-drilled hole on the left and right sides and comes with screws so you can attach it to the wall. Not only can it enhance stability, but it can also prevent it from falling due to unintentional impact. This over toilet rack will give you more peace of mind when using it. Therefore, you can also choose to install it on the balcony or laundry room as a laundry room shelf. 【Multiple Adjustable Design】The open storage dividers of this bathroom rack are adjustable. You can adjust and store it according to different sizes of shampoo or cosmetics. The height of the rod at the bottom is adjustable so it doesn't get in the way of the pipes. The toilet cabinet with adjustable feet allows you to adjust it on uneven ground, and it also ensures stability without shaking. 【Bathroom Space Saver】This over the toilet storage cabinet fits over most toilets and and helps you utilize the space above the toilet for storage. This bathroom organizer comes with one door cabinet, one drawer, adjustable shelves and open storage shelves. The powerful storage function makes it a tissue storage rack, towel storage rack and toiletry storage rack, etc, and can also be used to store shower gel, washing powder, perfume, candles, decorations, potted plants, etc. 【Dimension & Material】Size: 24.8*14.1*66inch(L*W*H). Our toilet storage consists of a sturdy iron frame and high-quality particleboard. Particleboard is highly moisture-resistant, durable and not easily deformed, so you can use it in the bathroom with confidence. With our proper care, the classic white finish is not only modern and elegant, but also very smooth and easy to clean. 【100% Satisfactory Service】We provide the necessary hardware and very detailed instructions for this toilet cabinet to help you assemble it easily. If the product has any quality problem, it can be replaced or refunded free of charge. If you have any questions or suggestions during assembly or use, you can contact us at any time, and we will reply to your email within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ifsUSpUhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hongtamoya","source_asin":"B0BS17YJH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS17YJH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS17YJH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
