window.products.push({"id":1123172,"name":"Tiptiper Tall Bathroom Cabinet, Slim Linen Closet with Adjustable Shelves, Removable X-Shaped Stand & Glass Door Cabinet, Bathroom Towel Storage Cabin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mM+jX+hmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAXIMIZE VERTICAL SPACE: With 3 open adjustable shelves, a removable X-shaped rack, and a glass-front cabinet, tiptiper tall bathroom storage cabinet offers optimal storage on the inside. Oh don't miss out the top. Add some home plants on there and voila, a fresh and welcoming bathroom is born. QUALITY YOU CAN TRUST: Durably crafted from sturdy MDF and given a creamy water-resistant white paint finish, this tall slim bathroom cabinet lasts longer, keeps your toiletries away from moisture and is sure to brighten your bathroom. STYLISH GLASS DESIGN: Safety frosted glass adds to the style of your home while giving you enough privacy. Finished in fresh bright white and taken up 14.6\"x12\" floor space, tiptiper slim cabinet also fits perfectly in your living room or dining room. FLEXIBLE STORAGE: The X-Shaped Stand can be used seperately and the upper shelf can be adjusted 2.5\" up or down so it's easier to fit in varying sized bottles of shampoo, gems, toilet paper and bath towels. NO SWEAT EASY ASSEMBLY: With every piece labled with number, hardware and instruction manual included, you'll set it up like building a lego. Please feel free to let us know if you need further assistance","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mM+jX+hmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiptiper","source_asin":"B08NFVXKFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NFVXKFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NFVXKFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1123173,"name":"Kuro-Obi Black Titanium Coated Stylish 8 Inch Chef Knife Made from German High Carbon Stainless Steel Designed in Tokyo Japan for Kitchen and Cooking ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qNHlm3GVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS \"KURO-OBI\"? – Kuro-Obi, the black belt that only masters of Japanese martial arts can wear, indicates that someone has reached the pinnacle of their craft. In Japan, since ancient times, martial arts were not just about strength but also a way of life, a lifelong journey for self-improvement.The requirement for the Kuro-Obi is a desire to explore and a passion for serving others. The path that leads to being a chef comes from your heart.Gathering and combining the best ingredients, while thinking about the people who will eat your food, you explore new tastes and sometimes this adventure leads to amazing new culinary experiences.This knife is your “Kuro-Obi”. TITANIUM COATING HAS MANY ADVANTAGES – The titanium coating is both hygienic and non-allergenic. It also provides excellent resistance to rust and corrosion. Titanium coated knives are stronger than knives made only from stainless steel and are very durable. Though stronger than stainless steel, titanium is lightweight, making them easy to use. The sleek shape and black design are perfect for your modern, stylish kitchen and dinner table. A BALANCE BETWEEN SHARPNESS, DURABILITY, AND WEIGHT – Extremely sharp blades are often easily chipped. So we have designed this knife's blade with a 13-degree angle per side, which is the optimal balance between sharpness and chipping resistance. The titanium coating adds toughness to the durable German stainless steel. So it's stronger and lighter than stainless steel only knives. The ergonomically shaped handle is hollow, which makes the knife much lighter. You will find this knife easy to handle and lightweight, a perfect tool for making wonderful meals for your friends and family. [ Size & Construction materials ] ･Size:13.4 x 2.0 x 0.9 in･Weight:7.8 oz･Blade:1.4116 stainless steel with black titanium coating･Handle: Hollow handle 430 stainless steel with black titanium coating","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qNHlm3GVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kuro-Obi-Knife","source_asin":"B0813442DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0813442DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0813442DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1123174,"name":"Kip & Nod Premium Removable Duvet Cover for Weighted Blanket - 48 x 72 - Ultra-Soft Minky - Sturdy Zipper Closure and 8 Ties (Duvet Cover ONLY)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T+V36qcbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Investing in Premium Quality Saves You Money and Frustration At Kip & Nod, we’ve created our weighted blanket duvet covers with your happiness in mind. Madewith high quality, ultra-soft minky fabric, our weighted blanket covers offer an extra layer of cozinessthroughout the year, from one season to the next. The minky dots add a layer of enhanced comfort forall, especially for those with sensory sensitivity. No Blanket Bunching: Stays Secure with 8-Ties Our weighted blanket duvet covers come with eight ties. Each tie is extra-long at seven inches, one oneach corner and each side ensuring there is no blanket bunching. When choosing a Kip & Nod removableduvet cover for weighted blankets, we guarantee your weighted blanket will remain secure. Pain-free Removal and Machine Wash Our hidden 59 inch zipper runs the length of the duvet cover making it extremely easy to insert andremove your weighted blanket. When it's time to wash your duvet, easily remove it without worryingabout ripping the fabric. With our protective duvet covers you no longer have to worry about washingyour heavy weighted blank!For easy care, machine wash on cold and tumble dry with no heat. That’s it! Variety and Simple Patterns Fit Your Style The Kip & Nod weighted blanket duvet cover comes in colors, fabrics & patterns that offer timeless goodlooks and an easy pairing with styles both traditional and contemporary alike. Our stylish, yet simplecovers effortlessly complement your existing style. Choose the Kip & Nod weighted blanket duvet size orcolor that fits your needs. We offer 48x72 twin and 60x80 queen size covers in different colors, patterns& fabrics. Package Includes 1 Duvet Cover for Weighted Blankets","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T+V36qcbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kip & Nod","source_asin":"B07MH8N363","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MH8N363","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MH8N363","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
