window.products.push({"id":1123189,"name":"Tumblers Made From Recycled Wine Bottles - set of 4 (Dark Green, 16 Oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51irTkGnLDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"About The Gr een Glass Company® The Green Glass Company strives to satisfy not only its recycling heritage but also its eclectic and diverse clientele.  With its patent on the unique wine bottle to goblet conversion process, The Green Glass Company team and its state-of-the-art equipment are pioneers in reclaimed glassware since 1992. All glassware is made from bottles rescued from the North American waste stream in our facility in Weston, Wisconsin. About our glassware The bottles are cut into two pieces: the bottom part becomes the tumbler, the top part lives on to become a goblet through a unique and patented process. So, no part of the bottle is wasted and re-purposing the bottles into glasses requires only a fraction of the energy versus making glasses from recycled glass. And most all of it is renewable energy.Talking about a green glass..! Bottles are also re-purposed into pitchers, vases, candle holders and even coat racks. Each drinking glass features the Green Glass’s PerfectRim™, a smooth, round rim for optimum drinking comfort. Made from bottles meant to protect their content, the glasses are very durable; ideal for everyday use. All glasses are fully annealed so they are safe to use in dishwashers and can even be placed in the refrigerator. Every effort is made to ship your glasses safely and eco-friendly. The glasses are packaged using recycled paper cup holders and bio degradable peanuts for impact protection, then packed in recycled cardboard boxes. Other glassware is packed in two-packs made from recycled cardboard and decorated with eco –friendly ink. It is simple, yet imaginative. It is conceptually elementary, yet technologically complex. It is an ordinary bottle, yet an extraordinary drinking glass. Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51irTkGnLDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Green Glass Company","source_asin":"B07Q5B3NHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q5B3NHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q5B3NHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
