window.products.push({"id":1123309,"name":"Digital Meat Milke Thermometer UPGRADE Magnetic Instant Read Thermometer Cooking Thermometer for Kitchen Grilling Food Milk Candy and Bath Water, Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ank26Ry8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Tired of overcooked beef, undercooked poultry & tasteless dried-out fish? Get ready for juicy roasts, tender turkeys, flaky fish & seafood, crusty breads, chewy candy & more with the most advanced, talking food thermometer available. - Designed for Simplicity Press the \"ON/OFF\" button and then pull the probe away from the meat thermometer body. To switch to Celsius, press the \"°C/°F\" button after opening the buckle of the battery. Magnetic attachment enables digital meat thermometer to attach it on refrigerator. What’s more, there is a hanging hole on the handle for convenient storage, you may hang the meat thermometer together with your cooker. This kitchen thermometer apply to Christmas turkey, meat, candy, yogurt, beef, steak, milk, tea, oil, coffee, cheese, burger, baking, fish, candle, deep fry, barbecue as well as bath water - Energy-saving This meat thermometer will shut off automatically if the readout stays for 10 minutes to prolong the battery life. You no longer need to replace the battery frequently. Enjoy your BBQ time leisurely with such a cute helper. - Warm Tips 1. Clean and sterillize the probe before use.(NEVER USE THE THERMOMETER IN A CLOSED OVEN)  2. Only the probe is waterproof. Please DO NOT COMPLETELY IMMERSE IN WATER. 3. The digital cooking thermometer may function abnormally under strong electromagnetic interference. - Specification Dimension: L5.85xW1.37xH0.86 inch Weight: 50g Materials: ABS, SUS304 Measurement Range: -50°C ~300°C /-58°F ~572°F Response Time: 3-4 seconds Accuracy: ±1°C( ±2°F), resolution:0.1°C (0.1°F) Auto Power off Time: 10 min Still unsure? FOREV Grill Thermometer provide lifetime warranty & a 45 days money back removes all risk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ank26Ry8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOREV","source_asin":"B07BP1LLY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BP1LLY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BP1LLY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
