window.products.push({"id":1123350,"name":"CASA STARLET Luxury Tiara Gold Napkin Rings Set of 6, Crystal Rhinestone Napkin Ring Holder for Wedding, Formal Events, Dinner Parties, Holiday Gather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TciW75ByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury Tiara Napkin rings add a touch of elegance and sophistication to table setting. They serve as beautiful decorative accents that instantly uplift the overall aesthetic of your dining area. They can also show your care and attention to detail. Easy Table Etiquette: Napkin rings provide a practical solution for keeping your napkins neatly folded and in place. Say goodbye to messy, crumpled napkins on your guests' laps or plates. With napkin rings, your table setting stays organized, ensuring a refined dining experience. Event Enhancements: Napkin rings are not limited to everyday dining. They're also fantastic for special events and celebrations, such as weddings, dinner parties, or holiday gatherings. Adding beautifully crafted napkin rings can transform a regular table into a memorable and festive centerpiece. Reusable and Sustainable: By using napkin rings, you promote sustainability by reducing paper waste. Instead of disposable napkins, you can invest in cloth napkins that can be paired with various napkin rings for multiple uses, minimizing your environmental footprint. Easy Maintenance: Napkin rings are generally low-maintenance. Depending on the material, a simple wipe or occasional polishing keeps them looking their best. They're a hassle-free addition to your tableware collection. Don't miss the chance to elevate your dining experience and impress your guests with stunning napkin rings. Discover the perfect set today and let your table setting shine!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TciW75ByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"casa starlet","source_asin":"B098QTG54L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098QTG54L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098QTG54L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1123351,"name":"DYD Mattress Protector Waterproof Soft & Cooling Bamboo Cover with Deep Pocket for Kids Adults | Organic & Breathable Encasement Quilted Fitted 8-18 i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cAivHeN-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ALL-ROUND MATTRESS PROTECTOR WITH AMPLE FEATURES — DYD waterproof mattress cover can help protect your expensive mattress against general wear and tear from day to day use, it can effectively extend the life of your mattress by staving off liquid spills. Our mattress cover can help improve your bed's level of hygiene and boost your general health. ADVANCED 3D AIR LAYER WITH BAMBOO FIBER MATERIAL — Derived from natural bamboo fiber, combined with the super comfortable 3D air layer. It provides a snuggly soft sensation as well as the bamboo ingredient lends a breathable and cooling effect. The perfect airflow system sets the foundation for a better night's sleep and makes you feel sleeping on the cloud. Great choice for who doesn't like hot feelings with quick heat absorbing and releasing feature. 100% WATERPROOF PROTECTION & IDEAL BREATHABLE OPTION — Unlike other products on the market, our quilted cover includes a breathable surface with a membrane back coating which made from TPU Rubber. It's designed to provide a physical protection that safeguards your mattress against dust, spills, perspiration while effectively block moisture and other undesirable substances. Our cover is water-resistant comes with non slip feature. OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED COVER — Our mattress protector is OEKO-TEX certified. Bamboo is an ideal sustainable material for mattress protector because it wicks away moisture and wet and helps stop odor-causing. The feature makes it a perfect option for children, the elderly, allergy-prone individuals or anyone with sensitive skin. Great choice for kids/pet pee potty training. EASY CLEANUP, TAILORED FIT, NOISELESS & COOLING FEELING — The cover provides a unique heat managing ability that reacts to temperature fluctuation as you sleep for all-night comfort and the softness lets you sink into your mattress without any unnecessary noise or ruffling. Enjoy your quiet night! The stretchy skirting and 360° grip conform to your mattress for a flawless all sides fit. Plus the cover is machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cAivHeN-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DYD","source_asin":"B0832GNCJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0832GNCJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0832GNCJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
