window.products.push({"id":1123404,"name":"Fimibuke Best Nurse Gifts - 20 OZ Tumbler Nurses Day Gift for Nurse, Doctor, Assistant - Insulated Cups for Appreciation Graduation Birthday Funny Pre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OFgSrnp5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT GIFT FOR THE BELOVED ONE: This gift tumbler for nurse with sayings:\"Best Nurse Ever\" are great gifts for Nurse's Day, Nurse Appreciation, Nurse Graduation, Nurse Practitioner, Christmas making them smile with every sip! In addition, packed in a beautiful gift box, these tumblers possess great performance in keeping their beverage cold or warm while decorated with beautiful and funny prints. Show nurse you care with this thoughtful gifts that will make their lives easier and more fun. SAFE & PREMIUM MATERIAL: Fimibuke 20oz tumbler with lid is made of premium 18/8 stainless steel, fully resistant to oxidation and corrosion. This stainless steel cups comprise BPA-FREE, food-safe and recyclable materials. These travel tumblers are not dishwasher safe, handwashing is highly recommended. These insulated cups are perfect to enjoy drinks at occasions such as home, office, beach, camping, picnic. This gift cup set includes 1 gift tumbler 20oz, 1 leak proof lid, 1 gift box. DOUBLE WALLED VACUUM INSULATED: With double-walled vacuum insulation, these insulated cups can preserve beverage temperature up to 24 hours for cold and 12 hours for hot. In addition, the double walled design and powder coated finish make the bottle sweat-free. Also, the top mouth is wide enough for refilling and inserting ice cubes or fruits. This cup is designed to preserve the quality and temperature of beverage such as coffee, iced fruit teas, wine, champagne, smoothies, sodas, milkshake. LEAKPROOF SLIDING LIDS: With this tumbler, the seal zone technology in the lids guarantees that each stainless steel tumbler is totally leak-proof and spill-proof. These BPA-FREE Lid are designed with a slider on the top for easier using. You can not only drink from the hole on the top for easy sipping, but also put your own straw in this straw friendly cups to enjoy smooth drinking. You can confidently take these leak proof insulated cups with lid around without any worries of spills. IDEAL GIFT GIVING & GUARANTEE: A great Nurse's Day gift for your lovely nurses, doctors and assistants. Just choose these cups with beautiful and funny prints and keep your beloved ones beverages quality and fresh. Fimibuke premium stainless steel tumbler is a great choice for Nurse's Day, Nurse Appreciation, Nurse Graduation, Nurse Practitioner, Christmas. Our Team offers superior customer service, high-quality material, and a life-time warranty. Any questions, send us your issues for solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OFgSrnp5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fimibuke","source_asin":"B0BRZXVF6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRZXVF6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRZXVF6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
