window.products.push({"id":1123413,"name":"Wonwo Waterproof Loveseat Covers Sofa Covers for 2 Cushion Couch Sofa Slipcover Furniture Protector for Dog Cat Pet Kid with Strap-Loveseat, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TdPjL7nbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.100% Waterproof This sofa protector cover is made of 4 protective layers: water-resistant top layer(100% polyester), waterproof film, soft inner layer(PP cotton), and non-slip backing. When your pets pee on the cover, most urine will stay on the surface(wipe it off with toilet paper or towel ), a small amount of it will soak through the first layer, then be isolated by the second layer(waterproof film), thus the couch dog covers can successfully keep your sofa clean and dry. 2.Non-slip design With strong silicone dots on the back, metal hooks and elastic strap, the pet covers for couches and sofas always stay in place.Providing protection every time when needed. 3.Comfortable touch Adopting special process, the couch cover for dogs keeps a great balance between comfort and function. It's smooth and soft. Keep you cozy and protect your sofa against water, pets fur, stains, daily wear etc. A workable choice for most kind of fabric or leather sofa. 4.Easy to install Step 1. Drape your sofa furniture with the cover. Step 2. Insert excess fabric between cushions and furniture frame to make sure fits is smooth. Step 3. Secure the sofa cover by attaching the elastic strap to the back of the sofa, so that the cover won't slide off the furniture. 5.Suggestion for washing： * Machine wash with cold water *Please gentle cycle *Safe for tumble dry at low heat *Light iron as needed *Do not bleach *Do not dry clean 6.Measure guide Most important size: the width of the sitting area Chair: 23.5” (60cm) Loveseat: 55.5” (140cm) Sofa: 71” (180cm) Oversize sofa: 78” (200cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TdPjL7nbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonwo","source_asin":"B085Q1ZLZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085Q1ZLZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085Q1ZLZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
