window.products.push({"id":1123674,"name":"Zyliss Susi 3 Garlic Press - Garlic and Ginger Mincer - Built-In Cleaner - Garlic Crusher, Mincer and Peeler - Dishwasher Safe - Cast Aluminum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wq8nOdiNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you love the taste of garlic in your food but don't enjoy the messy prep and cleanup, the Zyliss Susi 3 Garlic Press is a handy and compact tool that will change the way you prepare garlic. This garlic and ginger press is made from cast aluminum and quickly minces garlic without the need to peel the clove. This garlic mincer and cutter has a lightweight ergonomic handle that makes pressing garlic and ginger easy. The generous size hopper also accommodates small or large fresh garlic cloves. Once you have pressed the garlic, the nonstick coating and integrated cleaning tool allows for swift and easy cleanup. This garlic smasher is easy to clean and easy to store. Simply insert one or several small, unpeeled garlic cloves into the hopper and press handles together for instant results! Use the cleaning brush tool by pressing the red tab on the handle to detach it. After washing, just re-insert the cleaning tool. Enjoy the prep while keeping your hands safe and free from garlic odors with the Zyliss Susi 3 Garlic Press. Product Details Care: Dishwasher Safe Warranty: 5 years Dimensions: 1.02\" x 2.24\" x 6.1\" Weight: 0.31 lb. Since 1951, Zyliss has been creating kitchen tools and gadgets to meet the growing need of consumers worldwide. Behind every Zyliss kitchen tool is the \"design to delight\" principle. The belief is that all Zyliss products should work simply and efficiently while making customers smile every time you use the them. With over 70 years of experience in designing quality food preparation tools and gadgets, it is easy to see how Zyliss has become an internationally respected brand favored by both everyday cooks and gourmet chefs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wq8nOdiNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zyliss","source_asin":"B007D3V00Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007D3V00Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007D3V00Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
