window.products.push({"id":1123861,"name":"Pop Ice Cube Tray with Lid Bin and Scoop Square Ice Cubes Molds with storage box Ice maker Trays for Freezer With Container and Removable cover for Wh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MVqaNpjcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Release Ice Cubes : Pop Up One Key Press ,easy to release 32 pcs 1*1inch Square ice cubes one time .Revolutionary upgrade for traditional freezer ice trays on ice cubes making, releasing and storage. Easy to use : Simply place the ice tray upside down on the ice bin, close the lid and press the botton to unmold easily. You can see our video . The cubes are perfect size for small mouth bottles. They come out of the ice cube trays easily and fit in the freezer perfectly. Reusable Food Grade Material : The storage box and lid are ABS material , 2*32 Individual Ice Cubes molds are made of food grade PC + TPE which is BPA free, no smell, non-toxic. They are durable ,can be frozen and used repeatedly for a long time. Spill prevention design :The lid and The edges of the tray are designed higher for easy filling Water, not easy to spill. Water don’t fill above the max fill line to keep ice cubes in the perfect Square shape instead of sticking together. using scoop to take ice is more convenient and hygienic. Package : 2 pack stackable ice cube trays, a ice storage bin Bucket , a press plate lid and a scoop. This Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Bin can keep the ice cubes clean and far from freezer odors, dust.It be easily put into the refrigerator and help you save space in the freezer. Note : Ice box has just been taken out of the refrigerator, and there will be ice and will slipping. Please clean the box and lid with water and dry it.For ice tray ,Ice can be a bit difficult to remove if it is frozen in, leave the ice tray 2 minute out for a bit before pressing. Wide Application: The mini ice cube maker set is very suitable for family drinking and party use . office and student apartment. Not only can make water ice cubes for cocktails, wine, whiskey smoothies, but also you can DIY your favorite flavor with fruits or ice cream something .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MVqaNpjcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIRRKEP","source_asin":"B0BXXDKNWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXXDKNWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXXDKNWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
