window.products.push({"id":1123998,"name":"Zak Designs Callaway Dinner Plates, 10-Inch, White, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rNV53E3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Callaway 10-Inch White Dinner Plate by Zak Designs has an attractive and practical square shape. The set of six Callaway plates nest neatly for compact storage. Plates are made of 100-percent melamine and are BPA, PVC and phthalate free. Melamine has been popular for some time because of its durability and versatility. It can be used indoors and outdoors, is light weight, more resilient to drops and dings than porcelain and ceramic and is dishwasher safe (however, do not use in microwave). Zak adds style to the list; these plates have all the great characteristics of melamine ware plus, with their innovative and fresh design, they make melamine ware become stylish ware. Zak Designs offers a wide variety of dinnerware and travel ware, products at the forefront of tabletop trends for contemporary and on-the-go lifestyles. Playful, unexpected, spirited, colorful, modern, crisp and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rNV53E3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B00C4R5PFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C4R5PFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C4R5PFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1123999,"name":"Shark/Ninja S1200 Steam Mop Hard Floor Cleaner for Deep Cleaning and Sanitizing with XL Removable Easy Fill Water Tank 18-Foot Power Cord and Lightwei","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SUZLJGE-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Highlights Clean and sanitize* with just water. Easily fill and refill the removable XL water tank. Lightweight and compact. Easy to use and store. On-demand steam ready within 30 seconds. Cut through grease and grime without chemicals. * Sanitization studies were conducted under controlled test conditions.. The Shark Steam Mop lets you deep-clean your sealed hard floors with no chemicals, providing 99.9% sanitization*. Designed with ease in mind, the Shark Steam Mop is lightweight and maneuverable, allowing you to clean in tight spaces. Its large water tank means you can clean more floors without having to stop. And when you do need to refill, the removable tank makes it easy. Dimensions (Overall): 46.07 Inches (H) x 11.02 Inches (W) x 5.51 Inches (D) Weight: 7.89 Pounds Features: Portable Water Tank Capacity: 375 Milliliters Cable/Cord Length: 18 Feet Wattage Required: 1050 Watts Number of Speeds: 1 Cleaning Path Width: 11 Inches Recommended Surface Application: Hard Floor Recommended Product Application: Floor Power Source: Electric Battery: No Battery Used Shark Steam Mop for deep cleaning and sanitizing hard floors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SUZLJGE-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B0B496BTFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1123999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B496BTFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B496BTFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1124000,"name":"Inked and Screened \"North American P-51D Mustang Print, 18\" x 24\", Chalkboard - White Ink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GucrQI1rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Inked & screened posters are hand printed to order making each run a very limited edition. We're excited to offer high quality prints using non-toxic acrylic ink on top thick high quality 100 lb. Paper (6 prints weight over 1 pound!). screen printed products can be identified by their thick raised ink and in some cases an impression of the Mesh screen. Where digital and offset prints represent white by the lack of ink on an image, screen prints utilize a white ink to provide an incredibly vivid brilliant color unachievable by other forms of printing. This allows screen prints to stand out from traditionally printed posters and shine in a different light. Through limited runs, thick durable posters, brilliant colors and thick raised ink all done by hand by those that love this art form, each screen is printed uniquely for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GucrQI1rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inked and Screened","source_asin":"B01E5V69SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E5V69SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E5V69SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1124001,"name":"Let's Make Memories Personalized Their Own Name Beach Towel - Sports - Customized Towels for Pool - for Spring Break & Summer Fun - 30\" W x 60\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q4NEwPGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL BY THE POOL: Kids of all ages will get a big kick out of these colorful beach towels. Bold colors and a stylish vibe offer a great way to make a one-of-a-kind statement, no matter where your summertime adventures take you. UNIQUELY PERSONALIZED: Make sure everyone knows whose cool towel belongs to who. Choose the Sports (pictured), Stripes, Red Camo or Lime Green Camo design, and personalize it with any name up to 12 characters for a delightfully one-of-a-kind gift. A BEACH NECESSITY: Along with sunscreen and flip flops, a cozy towel is a must-have for any warm-weather outing. Whether you're putting your toes in the sand or lounging by the pool, these towels will make you smile all summer long. PREMIUM QUALITY: These towels take fun in the sun to another level. A generous 30\"W x 60\"L, they're made from a blend of 50% cotton and 50% polyester and are machine washable. Imported for final manufacture locally. A GIFT FOR ALL SEASONS: A thoughtful gift for your favorite beachgoer or water lover, these towels are a great choice for birthdays, vacations, family reunions, spring break or just because!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q4NEwPGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Let's Make Memories","source_asin":"B08Y962112","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y962112","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y962112","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
